# eBPF related
# Compiled BPF objects are build artifacts; the bpf2go-generated Go bindings
# (*_bpfel.go / *_bpfeb.go) ARE committed so `go build ./...` works without a
# clang/codegen step. Regenerate them with `make ebpf` / `go generate ./pkg/ebpf/`.
*.bpf.o
*.o

